ng the application over time. Cookie csrftoken Duration 1 year Description This cookie is associated with Django web development platform for python. Used to help protect the website against Cross-Site Request Forgery attacks Cookie m Duration 2 years Description Stripe sets this cookie for fraud prevention purposes. It identifies the device used to access the website, allowing the website to be formatted accordingly. Cookie cookieyes-* Duration 1 year Description CookieYes sets this cookie for consent solution management. Cookie asid Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description No description available. Cookie YII_CSRF_TOKEN Duration session Description This cookie is used a unique token that used in securing forms and other website inputs against XSS attacks. Cookie 30dc9280-2866-4cf7-bddc-f5362c0308b2 Duration 1 hour Description Description is currently not available. Cookie CONF:30dc9280-2866-4cf7-bddc-f5362c0308b2 Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description Description is currently not available. Cookie SignInMessage.9e994fa18756967411b9164be6638491 Duration session Description Description is currently not available. Functional Functional cookies help perform certain functionalities like sharing the content of the website on social media platforms, collecting feedback, and other third-party features. Cookie wp-wpml_current_language Duration session Description WordPress multilingual plugin sets this cookie to store the current language/language settings. Cookie __Secure-ROLLOUT_TOKEN Duration 6 months Description Description is currently not available. Cookie Cookies Duration session Description Stores your authenticated session while accessing the Gaiter Dollars portal, maintaining login state, enabling secure redirects, and supporting account features. Cookie UserSettings Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description Stores video player preferences like playback quality, captions, speed, volume, and layout to remember personalized viewing settings across Panopto se