ie is set by the Google recaptcha service to identify bots to protect the website against malicious spam attacks. Cookie ASP.NET_SessionId Duration session Description Issued by Microsoft's ASP.NET Application, this cookie stores session data during a user's website visit. Cookie AWSELB Duration session Description Associated with Amazon Web Services and created by Elastic Load Balancing, AWSELB cookie is used to manage sticky sessions across production servers. Cookie wpEmojiSettingsSupports Duration session Description WordPress sets this cookie when a user interacts with emojis on a WordPress site.  It helps determine if the user's browser can display emojis properly. Cookie ci_session Duration 2 hours Description This cookie is set as default session Cookie name in config.php in config folder in CodeIgniter. Cookie _GRECAPTCHA Duration 6 months Description Google Recaptcha service sets this cookie to identify bots to protect the website against malicious spam attacks. Cookie PHPSESSID Duration session Description This cookie is native to PHP applications. The cookie stores and identifies a user's unique session ID to manage user sessions on the website. The cookie is a session cookie and will be deleted when all the browser windows are closed. Cookie __AntiXsrfToken Duration session Description This cookie is used to prevent cross-scripting attacks. It holds a session to verify the login sessions. Cookie MoodleSession Duration session Description This cookie is set by the Moodle. This cookie is used for providing continuity and maintaining the visitor login from page to page. Cookie AWSELBCORS Duration 1 hour Description This cookie is used by Elastic Load Balancing from Amazon Web Services to effectively balance load on the servers. Cookie ols_443 Duration 1 hour Description Description is currently not available. Cookie ai_user Duration 1 year Description Microsoft Azure sets this cookie as a unique user identifier cookie, enabling counting of the number of users accessing the application over time. Cookie csrftoken Duration 1 year Description This cookie is associated with Django web development platform for python. Used to help protect the website against Cross-Site Request Forgery attacks Cookie m Duration 2 years Description Stripe sets this cookie for fraud prevention purposes. It identifies the device used to access the website, allowing the website to be formatted accordingly. Cookie cookieyes-* Duration 1 year Description CookieYes sets this cookie for consent solution management. Cookie asid Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description No description available. Cookie YII_CSRF_TOKEN Duration session Description This cookie is used a unique token that used in securing forms and other website inputs against XSS attacks. Cookie 30dc9280-2866-4cf7-bddc-f5362c0308b2 Duration 1 hour Description Description is currently not available. Cookie CONF:30dc9280-2866-4cf7-bddc-f5362c0308b2 Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description Description is currently not available. Cookie SignInMessage.9e994fa18756967411b9164be6638491 Duration session Description Description is currently not available. Functional Functional cookies help perform certain functionalities like sharing the content of the website on social media platforms, collecting feedback, and other third-party features. Cookie wp-wpml_current_language Duration session Description WordPress multilingual plugin sets this cookie to store the current language/language settings. Cookie __Secure-ROLLOUT_TOKEN Duration 6 months Description Description is currently not available. Cookie Cookies Duration session Description Stores your authenticated session while accessing the Gaiter Dollars portal, maintaining login state, enabling secure redirects, and supporting account features. Cookie UserSettings Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description Stores video player preferences like playback quality, captions, speed, volume, and layout to remember personalized viewing settings across