rvice to identify bots to protect the website against malicious spam attacks. Cookie ASP.NET_SessionId Duration session Description Issued by Microsoft's ASP.NET Application, this cookie stores session data during a user's website visit. Cookie AWSELB Duration session Description Associated with Amazon Web Services and created by Elastic Load Balancing, AWSELB cookie is used to manage sticky sessions across production servers. Cookie wpEmojiSettingsSupports Duration session Description WordPress sets this cookie when a user interacts with emojis on a WordPress site.  It helps determine if the user's browser can display emojis properly. Cookie ci_session Duration 2 hours Description This cookie is set as default session Cookie name in config.php in config folder in CodeIgniter. Cookie _GRECAPTCHA Duration 6 months Description Google Recaptcha service sets this cookie to identify bots to protect the website against malicious spam attacks. Cookie PHPSESSID Duration session Description This cookie is native to PHP applications. The cookie stores and identifies a user's unique session ID to manage user sessions on the website. The cookie is a session cookie and will be deleted when all the browser windows are closed. Cookie __AntiXsrfToken Duration session Description This cookie is used to prevent cross-scripting attacks. It holds a session to verify the login sessions. Cookie MoodleSession Duration session Description This cookie is set by the Moodle. This cookie is used for providing continuity and maintaining the visitor login from page to page. Cookie AWSELBCORS Duration 1 hour Description This cookie is used by Elastic Load Balancing from Amazon Web Services to effectively balance load on the servers. Cookie ols_443 Duration 1 hour Description Description is currently not available. Cookie ai_user Duration 1 year Description Microsoft Azure sets this cookie as a unique user identifier cookie, enabling counting of the number of users accessing the application over time. Cookie csrftoken Duration 1 year Description This cookie is associated with Django web development platform for python. Used to help protect the website against Cross-Site Request Forgery attacks Cookie m Duration 2 years Description Stripe sets this cookie for fraud prevention purposes. It identifies the device used to access the website, allowing the website to be formatted accordingly. Cookie cookieyes-* Duration 1 year Description CookieYes sets this cookie for consent solution management. Cookie asid Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description No description available. Cookie YII_CSRF_TOKEN Duration session Description This cookie is used a unique token that used in securing forms and other website inputs against XSS attacks. Cookie 30dc9280-2866-4cf7-bddc-f5362c0308b2 Duration 1 hour Description Description is currently not available. Cookie CONF:30dc9280-2866-4cf7-bddc-f5362c0308b2 Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description Description is currently not available. Cookie SignInMessage.9e994fa18756967411b9164be6638491 Duration session Description Description is currently not available. Functional Functional cookies help perform certain functionalities like sharing the content of the website on social media platforms, collecting feedback, and other third-party features. Cookie wp-wpml_current_language Duration session Description WordPress multilingual plugin sets this cookie to store the current language/language settings. Cookie __Secure-ROLLOUT_TOKEN Duration 6 months Description Description is currently not available. Cookie Cookies Duration session Description Stores your authenticated session while accessing the Gaiter Dollars portal, maintaining login state, enabling secure redirects, and supporting account features. Cookie UserSettings Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description Stores video player preferences like playback quality, captions, speed, volume, and layout to remember personalized viewing settings across Panopto sessions. Cookie idsrv.partial Duration session Description Stores temporary authentication state during multi-step sign-in and logout, enabling session continuity, redirect handling, and access to protected CMS content. Cookie ytidb::LAST_RESULT_ENTRY_KEY Duration Never Expires Description The cookie ytidb::LAST_RESULT_ENTRY_KEY is used by YouTube to store the last search result entry that was clicked by the user. This information is used to improve the user experience by providing more relevant search results in the future. Cookie sp_t Duration 1 year Description The sp_t cookie is set by Spotify to implement audio content from Spotify on the website and also registers information on user interaction related to the audio content. Cookie sp_landing Duration 1 day Description The sp_landing is set by Spotify to implement audio content from Spotify on the website and also registers information on user interaction related to the audio content. Cookie clearoutside_csrf_cookie Duration 2 hours Description Stores a CSRF token to validate requests, preventing unauthorized actions and securing user interactions during form submissions and sessions online. Cookie clearoutside_session Duration 2 hours Description Stores session data to maintain chosen forecast location, display preferences, and recent interactions, ensuring consistent, personalized weather imagery across pages. Cookie 54cd6e38659c1d604586394daae50304f801600aac3abcc7679098638b62d986 Duration session Description Supports Blackbaud webforms by maintaining session state, remembering donor inputs, validating fields, and enabling secure donation processing and form submission. Analytics Analytical cookies are used to understand how visitors interact with the website. These cookies help provide information on metrics such as the number of visitors, bounce rate, traffic source, etc. Cookie _ga Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description Google Analytics sets this cookie to calculate visitor, session and campaign data and track site usage for the site's analytics report. The cookie stores information anonymously and assigns a randomly generated number to recognise unique visitors. Cookie _gid Duration 1 day Description Google Analytics sets this cookie to store information on how visitors use a website while also creating an analytics report of the website's performance. Some of the collected data includes the number of visitors, their source, and the pages they visit anonymously. Cookie _gat_gtag_UA_* Duration 1 minute Description Google Analytics sets this cookie to store a unique user ID. Cookie _ga_* Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description Google Analytics sets this cookie to store and count page views. Cookie _gcl_au Duration 3 months Description Google Tag Manager sets the cookie to experiment advertisement efficiency of websites using their services. Cookie vuid Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description Vimeo installs this cookie to collect tracking information by setting a unique ID to embed videos on the website. Cookie _hjSessionUser_* Duration 1 year Description Hotjar sets this cookie to ensure data from subsequent visits to the same site is attributed to the same user ID, which persists in the Hotjar User ID, which is unique to that site. Cookie _hjSession_* Duration 1 hour Description Hotjar sets this cookie to ensure data from subsequent visits to the same site is attributed to the same user ID, which persists in the Hotjar User ID, which is unique to that site. Cookie _hjTLDTest Duration session Description To determine the most generic cookie path that has to be used instead of the page hostname, Hotjar sets the _hjTLDTest cookie to store different URL substring alternatives until it fails. Cookie _gat_UA-* Duration 1 minute Description Google Analytics sets this cookie for user behaviour tracking. Cookie _scor_uid Duration 1 year 24 days Description Stores a unique identifier to measure audience size, analyze browsing behavior, and improve advertising relevance and content performance across websites. Performance Performance cookies are used to understand and analyse the key performance indexes of the website which helps in delivering a better user experience for the visitors. Cookie AWSALB Duration 7 days Description AWSALB is an application load balancer cookie set by Amazon Web Services to map the session to the target. Cookie __utma Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description Google Analytics sets this cookie to distinguish users and sessions. The cookie is created when the JavaScript library executes and there are no existing __utma cookies. The cookie is updated every time data is sent to Google Analytics. Cookie __utmc Duration session Description Google Analytics sets this cookie to enable interoperability with urchin.js, an older version of Google Analytics and is used in conjunction with the __utmb cookie to determine new sessions/visits. It is deleted when the user closes the browser. Cookie __utmz Duration 6 months Description Google Analytics sets this cookie to store the traffic source or campaign by which the visitor reached the site. Cookie __utmt Duration 10 minutes Description Google Analytics sets this cookie to inhibit the request rate. Cookie __utmb Duration 1 hour Description Google Analytics sets this cookie to determine new sessions/visits. __utmb cookie is created when the JavaScript library executes and there are no existing __utma cookies. It is updated every time data is sent to Google Analytics. Advertisement Advertisement cookies are used to provide visitors with customised advertisements based on the pages you visited previously and to analyse the effectiveness of the ad campaigns. Cookie IDE Duration 1 year 24 days Description Google DoubleClick IDE cookies store information about how the user uses the website to present them with relevant ads according to the user profile. Cookie test_cookie Duration 15 minutes Description doubleclick.net sets this cookie to determine if the user's browser supports cookies. Cookie elfsight_viewed_recently Duration Less than a minute Description Stores identifiers of recently viewed pages or products to display a personalized recently viewed widget and improve navigation across sessions. Cookie _hashV Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description Stores a hashed visitor identifier to preserve portal preferences, attribute marketing campaigns, and optimize campus-visit scheduling, analytics, and user experience. Cookie YSC Duration session Description Youtube sets this cookie to track the views of embedded videos on Youtube pages. Cookie VISITOR_INFO1_LIVE Duration 6 months Description YouTube sets this cookie to measure bandwidth, determining whether the user gets the new or old player interface. Cookie VISITOR_PRIVACY_METADATA Duration 6 months Description YouTube sets this cookie to store the user's cookie consent state for the current domain. Cookie NID Duration 6 months Description Google sets the cookie for advertising purposes; to limit the number of times the user sees an ad, to unwanted mute ads, and to measure the effectiveness of ads. Cookie __Secure-YEC Duration past Description Description is currently not available. Cookie __Secure-YNID Duration 6 months Description Suivi d'audience et de comportement de lecture du lecteur vidéo YouTube. Uncategorised Other uncategorised cookies are those that are being analysed and have not been classified into a category as yet. No cookies to display. Reject All Save My Preferences Accept All Powered by Skip to content Search for: Search Current Students Alumni Give Apply Now Account Expand myBU Moodle Webmail Octopus Library Programs Expand Undergraduate Graduate Academic Experience Flexible Curriculum Experiential Learning Academic Support Admissions Expand Admission Process Admission Requirements Tuition and Fees Scholarships and Bursaries Financial Aid Talk to a recruiter Student Experience Expand Residence Clubs and Events Gaiters Athletics Student Services Discover Bishop's Expand Our Story Discover the region Equity, Diversity and Inclusion Indigenous Community and Reconciliation Research Expand Office of Resarch and Graduate Studies Canada Research Chairs Funding and Awards Student Research Scholarships Toggle Menu Search for: Search Career and Transition Services Career and Transition Services (CATS) Services Employers Meet the Team BE ENGAGED. BE PURPLE. BU. Career and Transition Services (CATS) empower our students to explore possibilities and engage with their future by providing comprehensive resources and guidance for career exploration and skill development. We are dedicated to creating a supportive and inclusive environment that fosters personal and professional growth, helping every student reach their full potential. Begin with the end in mind When students arrive at BU, they should already be thinking about their departure! We are proud to operate within a curricular framework where we support learning outside the classroom in intentional and meaningful ways. CATS supports and empowers students to explore possibilities, opportunities and critically engage with their future. More on our Curricular Framework Services for Students Discover our comprehensive suite of employment support services designed to empower your academic and professional journey. Come explore offerings such as Resume/CV Review, Cover Letter Review, Job Search Support, Career Exploration, and more! Service Offerings Job Board Come check out our Job Board, a one-stop platform featuring internships, part-time jobs, and full-time opportunities for students and alumni alike, from top employers across various industries. Find your Next Job Events Stay connected and informed with our Events section, showcasing an array of campus activities, guest lectures, workshops, and networking opportunities. Events Networking and Mentorship Networking is extremely important for university students, as it opens a world of opportunities and enhances their academic and professional journey. Connect with experienced professionals through our mentorship programs, designed to offer invaluable guidance, support, and insights. Get Connected Resources Access a wealth of knowledge with our Resources section, featuring academic materials, research databases, career guidance, and exclusive tools to help students achieve success. Check out our specialized resources for equity-seeking students. Resources Employers Forge a brighter future by connecting with our talented students. Your partnership opens doors to creativity, growth, and success, shaping the leaders of tomorrow. Employers Get to know your dedicated CATS team! Navigating your career journey can be complex. The Career and Transition Services (CATS) team is here for you. We offer tailored services from career counseling to job search assistance, workshops, resume help, and plenty of other resources. Meet the Team JOIN THE MULTI VERSITY Apply Now Current Students Library Academic Calendar Sessional Dates Timetable Student Services Faculty & Staff IT Services Teaching & Learning Centre Mail & Print Services Security & Parking Parents & Advisors Admissions Tuition & Fees Resources for Guidance Counsellors Resources for Parents of Students Arts & Community Events Centennial Theatre Foreman Art Gallery Musique Chez Nous Donald Lecture Series Sports & Recreation Centre Let’s Connect Contact Bishop’s Directions and Maps Media Inquiries Recruitment Chairs and Deans About Bishop’s Governance and Administration Executive Leadership Strategic Plan 2025-2029 Historical Timeline Careers at Bishop’s Copyright © 2026 Bishop's University Disclaimer Programs Toggle child menu Expand Undergraduate Graduate Academic Experience Flexible Curriculum Experiential Learning Academic Support Admissions Toggle child menu Expand Admission Process Admission Requirements Tuition and Fees Scholarships and Bursaries Financial Aid Talk to a recruiter Student Experience Toggle child menu Expand Residence Clubs and Events Gaiters Athlet